        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Carol Kane, Andy Kaufman, Danny Kallis, Michael McKean, John Goodman, Desmond Harrington\n- Works/Characters: Taxi, Latka Gravas, My First Mister\n\nFacts:\n- In the early 1980s, Carol Kane appeared on the television series Taxi as the wife of Latka, a character played by Andy Kaufman.\n- Carol Kane won two Emmy Awards for her work on Taxi.\n- Latka Gravas is a fictional character on the television sitcom Taxi portrayed by Andy Kaufman.\n- The film My First Mister co-stars Carol Kane, Michael McKean, John Goodman, and Desmond Harrington.\n- Danny Kallis was associated with Taxi as well as The Upper Hand, The Charmings, Silver Spoons, and Mama's Family.",
